<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #fff1f2; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 6px solid #E11D48; overflow: hidden; }
        .content { padding: 30px; }
        .refund-badge { background-color: #DCFCE7; color: #166534; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 100px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="content">
            <h2 style="margin-top: 0; color: #9F1239;">Order Cancelled</h2>
            
            <p>Hi {{customerName}},</p>
            
            <p>We regret to inform you that <strong>{{storeName}}</strong> could not fulfill your order <strong>#{{orderId}}</strong>.</p>
            
            <p><strong>Reason given:</strong><br/>
            <i style="color: #666;">"{{reason}}"</i></p>

            <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 20px 0;" />

            <h3>Refund Status</h3>
            <p>We have automatically initiated a full refund to your payment method.</p>
            
            <span class="refund-badge">✓ REFUND INITIATED</span>
            
            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-top: 20px;">
                Wallet refunds are instant. Bank refunds may take 3-5 business days depending on your bank.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>